# Chocobo Racetrack, {3}{G}{G}: "Whenever a land you control enters, create a 2/2 green Bird creature token with 'Whenever a land
# you control enters, this token gets +1/+0 until end of turn'" (CR 603.2, 111.1, 611.2a). Bot1 pays exactly with Black Lotus
# (GGG), Mox Emerald and Mox Pearl; the Forest it plays afterwards makes the first Bird, a 2/2 green Bird that did not see the
# land. Bot2's Island on turn 2 does nothing (it is not a land Bot1 controls). The turn-3 Forest makes a second Bird (2/2) and
# the first Bird gets +1/+0 (3/2); on turn 5 the first Bird is 2/2 again, the pump having ended with that turn.

